<!DOCTYPE html><!--mf5VNDz3U6PbuWfmQy9mq--><html lang="en" class="scroll-smooth"><head><meta charSet="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"/><link rel="preload" href="/_next/static/media/01ad422bcd0a01ad-s.p.ttf" as="font" crossorigin="" type="font/ttf"/><link rel="preload" href="/_next/static/media/6c596dfcddeca1e9-s.p.woff2" as="font" crossorigin="" type="font/woff2"/><link rel="preload" href="/_next/static/media/fedf4c9280b16369-s.p.woff2" as="font" crossorigin="" type="font/woff2"/><link rel="stylesheet" href="/_next/static/css/3e2c8dfa61c4c66e.css" data-precedence="next"/><link rel="preload" as="script" fetchPriority="low" href="/_next/static/chunks/webpack-7dbd887d1a2e16f6.js"/><script src="/_next/static/chunks/4bd1b696-096d35a2bd1da3af.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/794-37dad9bbc14b04b8.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/main-app-753d8a8b89c42ffc.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/500-5d45efbf86b8d36e.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/app/layout-2900f7ecc18c0c9d.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/409-3a286ec9422c21dc.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/app/pricing/page-bf9ae844951a7731.js" async=""></script><meta name="next-size-adjust" content=""/><title>Pricing | SMS Buddy</title><meta name="description" content="Explore SMS Buddy credit packs for your business in Sri Lanka. Compare indicative pack totals, find a pack for your usage, and create your account."/><meta property="og:title" content="Pricing | SMS Buddy"/><meta property="og:description" content="Simple, transparent SMS pricing. No monthly subscriptions. Pay once for credits and use them within 3 months."/><meta property="og:url" content="https://smsbuddy.lk/pricing"/><meta property="og:site_name" content="SMS Buddy"/><meta property="og:type" content="website"/><meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image"/><meta name="twitter:title" content="Pricing | SMS Buddy"/><meta name="twitter:description" content="Simple, transparent SMS pricing. No monthly subscriptions. Pay once for credits and use them within 3 months."/><link rel="icon" href="/favicon.ico?9f2a70bc6c15215f" type="image/x-icon" sizes="16x16"/><link rel="icon" href="/icon.svg?6fef986e659fabe2" type="image/svg+xml" sizes="any"/><script src="/_next/static/chunks/polyfills-42372ed130431b0a.js" noModule=""></script></head><body class="__variable_207d67 __variable_53f2d8 __variable_8dd2fb __variable_39d03d bg-background text-text font-body antialiased"><div hidden=""><!--$--><!--/$--></div><script type="application/json" id="smsbuddy-design-contract">{"THESIS":"Make business SMS tangible beside a direct account-creation CTA.","OWN_WORLD":"Cobalt retail-sign typography, white canvas, pale sky messaging workspace, flat geometric controls.","STORY":"Understand the offer, preview a message, learn setup and credit conditions, create an account.","FIRST_VIEWPORT":"Centered headline and signup action above a full-width interactive composer and realistic recipient phone.","FORM":"Retail window signage translated into a messaging workspace, candidate 3, seed 55f202a5.","FINISH":"unreviewed and undocumented is unfinished; this build ends with the finish review, the verdict, and DESIGN.md"}</script><a class="sb-skip-link" href="#main-content">Skip to content</a><header class="sb-header"><nav class="sb-shell sb-nav" aria-label="Main navigation"><a aria-label="SMS Buddy home" href="/"><span class="sb-brand"><svg viewBox="0 0 72 88" width="36" height="36" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 4H42C55 4 64 13 64 25C64 32 61 37 56 40C63 43 67 49 67 57C67 69 57 76 43 76H19L8 83C6 84 4 83 4 80V10C4 7 7 4 10 4ZM21 27C15 27 12 31 12 37V58C12 60 14 61 16 59L23 54H37C45 54 49 48 49 41C49 33 44 27 37 27Z" fill="currentColor" fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg><span>SMS Buddy</span></span></a><div class="sb-nav-links"><a href="/features">Product</a><a aria-current="page" href="/pricing">Pricing</a><a href="/for-agencies">For agencies</a><a href="/for-developers">For developers</a></div><div class="sb-nav-actions"><a class="sb-login" href="https://portal.smsbuddy.lk">Log in</a><a class="sb-primary sb-nav-cta" href="https://portal.smsbuddy.lk/register" data-cta-location="header">Get Started <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"></path></svg></a><button class="sb-menu-toggle" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="mobile-navigation" aria-label="Open navigation"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 6h16M4 12h16M4 18h16"></path></svg></button></div></nav></header><div class="min-h-screen"><main id="main-content"><section class="sb-section border-b border-slate-200 bg-white"><div class="sb-shell"><div class="max-w-3xl"><h1 class="sb-page-heading">A credit pack that fits your next move.</h1><p class="sb-lead mt-6 max-w-2xl">Plan your campaigns and customer updates with pay-as-you-go credits. Choose what you expect to use, with no monthly subscription.</p><div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4"><a class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 font-heading font-semibold transition-all duration-200 cursor-pointer select-none bg-primary text-white hover:bg-primary-dark active:bg-primary-dark hand-drawn-shadow-sm hover:translate-x-[1px] hover:translate-y-[1px] hover:shadow-none px-6 py-3 text-base rounded-2xl sb-primary" data-cta-location="pricing-hero" href="https://portal.smsbuddy.lk/register">Get Started</a><a class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 font-heading font-semibold transition-all duration-200 cursor-pointer select-none bg-transparent text-text hover:bg-background-alt border-2 border-border px-6 py-3 text-base rounded-2xl sb-secondary" href="/contact">Talk to the team</a></div><p class="mt-4 text-sm text-slate-500">Opens the account portal. Credits are valid for 3 months.</p></div></div></section><section class="sb-section bg-slate-50" aria-labelledby="pack-chooser-heading"><div class="sb-shell"><div class="mb-8 max-w-2xl"><h2 id="pack-chooser-heading" class="text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-slate-950 sm:text-4xl">Find your pack.</h2><p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-slate-600">Start with your expected credit usage. This chooser compares pack sizes and totals so you can plan your spend.</p></div><div class="grid overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 bg-white lg:grid-cols-2"><div class="p-6 sm:p-9"><label for="_R_29bsnrb_" class="block text-lg font-semibold text-slate-950">How many credits do you need?</label><p id="_R_29bsnrb_-hint" class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600">Enter the credits you expect to use within 3 months. We’ll show the smallest listed pack that covers them.</p><input id="_R_29bsnrb_" type="number" inputMode="numeric" min="1" step="1" aria-invalid="false" aria-describedby="_R_29bsnrb_-hint" class="mt-6 w-full rounded-xl border border-slate-300 bg-white px-4 py-4 text-3xl font-semibold tabular-nums text-slate-950 outline-none focus:border-blue-600 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-600/20" value="5000"/><div class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-2" aria-label="Example credit quantities"><button type="button" aria-pressed="false" class="min-h-11 rounded-lg border px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium transition-colors focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-blue-600 border-slate-200 text-slate-600 hover:border-blue-400 hover:text-blue-700">1,000</button><button type="button" aria-pressed="true" class="min-h-11 rounded-lg border px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium transition-colors focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-blue-600 border-blue-600 bg-blue-50 text-blue-800">5,000</button><button type="button" aria-pressed="false" class="min-h-11 rounded-lg border px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium transition-colors focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-blue-600 border-slate-200 text-slate-600 hover:border-blue-400 hover:text-blue-700">30,000</button></div><p class="mt-6 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-500">A long message or one using Unicode characters may use multiple credits. Check the credit count for your message before sending.</p></div><div aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true" class="flex flex-col justify-center bg-slate-50 p-6 sm:p-9"><p class="text-sm font-medium text-blue-700">Smallest pack covering your credits</p><h3 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-slate-950">5,000<!-- --> credits</h3><p class="mt-1 text-sm text-slate-500">SB5X<!-- --> pack</p><p class="mt-6 text-3xl font-semibold tabular-nums text-slate-950">LKR 2,900.00</p><p class="mt-1 text-sm text-slate-600">Indicative pack total</p><dl class="mt-6 space-y-3 border-t border-slate-200 pt-5 text-sm"><div class="flex flex-wrap justify-between gap-2"><dt class="text-slate-600">Effective price per credit</dt><dd class="font-semibold text-slate-900">LKR 0.58</dd></div><div class="flex flex-wrap justify-between gap-2"><dt class="text-slate-600">Credits remaining after your estimate</dt><dd class="font-semibold text-slate-900">0</dd></div><div class="flex flex-wrap justify-between gap-2"><dt class="text-slate-600">Validity from purchase</dt><dd class="font-semibold text-slate-900">3 months</dd></div></dl><p class="mt-6 text-xs leading-relaxed text-slate-500">Prices are indicative. Confirm current rates, taxes, and sender-name setup costs before buying.</p><a class="mt-4 w-fit text-sm font-semibold text-blue-700 underline underline-offset-4 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 focus-visible:outline-blue-600" href="/contact">Ask about pricing</a></div></div></div></section><section class="sb-section bg-white" aria-labelledby="all-packs-heading"><div class="sb-shell"><div class="mb-8 max-w-2xl"><h2 id="all-packs-heading" class="text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-slate-950 sm:text-4xl">Every option, clearly listed.</h2><p id="pricing-conditions" class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-slate-600">Prices are indicative. Confirm current rates, taxes, and any sender-name setup costs before buying. All credits have a 3-month validity.</p></div><div class="hidden overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 md:block"><table class="w-full text-left text-sm" aria-describedby="pricing-conditions"><caption class="sr-only">SMS Buddy indicative credit pricing. Effective rate is the pack total divided by its credit quantity.</caption><thead class="bg-slate-50 text-slate-600"><tr><th scope="col" class="px-6 py-5 font-medium">Option</th><th scope="col" class="px-6 py-5 text-right font-medium">Credits</th><th scope="col" class="px-6 py-5 text-right font-medium">Indicative total</th><th scope="col" class="px-6 py-5 text-right font-medium">Effective price / credit</th></tr></thead><tbody class="divide-y divide-slate-200"><tr class="text-slate-700"><th scope="row" class="px-6 py-5 font-semibold text-slate-950">Pay As You Go</th><td class="px-6 py-5 text-right tabular-nums">1</td><td class="px-6 py-5 text-right font-semibold tabular-nums">LKR 0.60</td><td class="px-6 py-5 text-right tabular-nums">LKR 0.60</td></tr><tr class="text-slate-700"><th scope="row" class="px-6 py-5 font-semibold text-slate-950">SB1X</th><td class="px-6 py-5 text-right tabular-nums">1,000</td><td class="px-6 py-5 text-right font-semibold tabular-nums">LKR 580.00</td><td class="px-6 py-5 text-right tabular-nums">LKR 0.58</td></tr><tr class="text-slate-700"><th scope="row" class="px-6 py-5 font-semibold text-slate-950">SB5X</th><td class="px-6 py-5 text-right tabular-nums">5,000</td><td class="px-6 py-5 text-right font-semibold tabular-nums">LKR 2,900.00</td><td class="px-6 py-5 text-right tabular-nums">LKR 0.58</td></tr><tr class="text-slate-700"><th scope="row" class="px-6 py-5 font-semibold text-slate-950">SB10X</th><td class="px-6 py-5 text-right tabular-nums">10,000</td><td class="px-6 py-5 text-right font-semibold tabular-nums">LKR 5,800.00</td><td class="px-6 py-5 text-right tabular-nums">LKR 0.58</td></tr><tr class="text-slate-700"><th scope="row" class="px-6 py-5 font-semibold text-slate-950">SB30X</th><td class="px-6 py-5 text-right tabular-nums">30,000</td><td class="px-6 py-5 text-right font-semibold tabular-nums">LKR 17,400.00</td><td class="px-6 py-5 text-right tabular-nums">LKR 0.58</td></tr><tr class="text-slate-700"><th scope="row" class="px-6 py-5 font-semibold text-slate-950">SB50X</th><td class="px-6 py-5 text-right tabular-nums">50,000</td><td class="px-6 py-5 text-right font-semibold tabular-nums">LKR 29,000.00</td><td class="px-6 py-5 text-right tabular-nums">LKR 0.58</td></tr><tr class="text-slate-700"><th scope="row" class="px-6 py-5 font-semibold text-slate-950">SB75X</th><td class="px-6 py-5 text-right tabular-nums">75,000</td><td class="px-6 py-5 text-right font-semibold tabular-nums">LKR 43,500.00</td><td class="px-6 py-5 text-right tabular-nums">LKR 0.58</td></tr><tr class="text-slate-700"><th scope="row" class="px-6 py-5 font-semibold text-slate-950">SB100X</th><td class="px-6 py-5 text-right tabular-nums">100,000</td><td class="px-6 py-5 text-right font-semibold tabular-nums">LKR 58,000.00</td><td class="px-6 py-5 text-right tabular-nums">LKR 0.58</td></tr><tr class="text-slate-700"><th scope="row" class="px-6 py-5 font-semibold text-slate-950">SB130X</th><td class="px-6 py-5 text-right tabular-nums">130,000</td><td class="px-6 py-5 text-right font-semibold tabular-nums">LKR 75,400.00</td><td class="px-6 py-5 text-right tabular-nums">LKR 0.58</td></tr><tr class="text-slate-700"><th scope="row" class="px-6 py-5 font-semibold text-slate-950">SB150X</th><td class="px-6 py-5 text-right tabular-nums">150,000</td><td class="px-6 py-5 text-right font-semibold tabular-nums">LKR 87,000.00</td><td class="px-6 py-5 text-right tabular-nums">LKR 0.58</td></tr></tbody></table></div><ul class="grid gap-3 md:hidden" aria-describedby="pricing-conditions"><li class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 p-5"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline justify-between gap-2"><h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-950">Pay As You Go</h3><p class="text-sm text-slate-600">1<!-- --> <!-- -->credit</p></div><p class="mt-3 text-xl font-semibold tabular-nums text-slate-950">LKR 0.60</p><p class="mt-1 text-sm text-slate-500">Indicative total · <!-- -->LKR 0.60<!-- --> / credit</p></li><li class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 p-5"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline justify-between gap-2"><h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-950">SB1X</h3><p class="text-sm text-slate-600">1,000<!-- --> <!-- -->credits</p></div><p class="mt-3 text-xl font-semibold tabular-nums text-slate-950">LKR 580.00</p><p class="mt-1 text-sm text-slate-500">Indicative total · <!-- -->LKR 0.58<!-- --> / credit</p></li><li class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 p-5"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline justify-between gap-2"><h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-950">SB5X</h3><p class="text-sm text-slate-600">5,000<!-- --> <!-- -->credits</p></div><p class="mt-3 text-xl font-semibold tabular-nums text-slate-950">LKR 2,900.00</p><p class="mt-1 text-sm text-slate-500">Indicative total · <!-- -->LKR 0.58<!-- --> / credit</p></li><li class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 p-5"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline justify-between gap-2"><h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-950">SB10X</h3><p class="text-sm text-slate-600">10,000<!-- --> <!-- -->credits</p></div><p class="mt-3 text-xl font-semibold tabular-nums text-slate-950">LKR 5,800.00</p><p class="mt-1 text-sm text-slate-500">Indicative total · <!-- -->LKR 0.58<!-- --> / credit</p></li><li class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 p-5"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline justify-between gap-2"><h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-950">SB30X</h3><p class="text-sm text-slate-600">30,000<!-- --> <!-- -->credits</p></div><p class="mt-3 text-xl font-semibold tabular-nums text-slate-950">LKR 17,400.00</p><p class="mt-1 text-sm text-slate-500">Indicative total · <!-- -->LKR 0.58<!-- --> / credit</p></li><li class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 p-5"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline justify-between gap-2"><h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-950">SB50X</h3><p class="text-sm text-slate-600">50,000<!-- --> <!-- -->credits</p></div><p class="mt-3 text-xl font-semibold tabular-nums text-slate-950">LKR 29,000.00</p><p class="mt-1 text-sm text-slate-500">Indicative total · <!-- -->LKR 0.58<!-- --> / credit</p></li><li class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 p-5"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline justify-between gap-2"><h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-950">SB75X</h3><p class="text-sm text-slate-600">75,000<!-- --> <!-- -->credits</p></div><p class="mt-3 text-xl font-semibold tabular-nums text-slate-950">LKR 43,500.00</p><p class="mt-1 text-sm text-slate-500">Indicative total · <!-- -->LKR 0.58<!-- --> / credit</p></li><li class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 p-5"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline justify-between gap-2"><h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-950">SB100X</h3><p class="text-sm text-slate-600">100,000<!-- --> <!-- -->credits</p></div><p class="mt-3 text-xl font-semibold tabular-nums text-slate-950">LKR 58,000.00</p><p class="mt-1 text-sm text-slate-500">Indicative total · <!-- -->LKR 0.58<!-- --> / credit</p></li><li class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 p-5"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline justify-between gap-2"><h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-950">SB130X</h3><p class="text-sm text-slate-600">130,000<!-- --> <!-- -->credits</p></div><p class="mt-3 text-xl font-semibold tabular-nums text-slate-950">LKR 75,400.00</p><p class="mt-1 text-sm text-slate-500">Indicative total · <!-- -->LKR 0.58<!-- --> / credit</p></li><li class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 p-5"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline justify-between gap-2"><h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-950">SB150X</h3><p class="text-sm text-slate-600">150,000<!-- --> <!-- -->credits</p></div><p class="mt-3 text-xl font-semibold tabular-nums text-slate-950">LKR 87,000.00</p><p class="mt-1 text-sm text-slate-500">Indicative total · <!-- -->LKR 0.58<!-- --> / credit</p></li></ul><p class="mt-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-500">Effective price per credit is the pack total divided by the credits included. Long or Unicode messages may use more than one credit.</p></div></section><section class="sb-section border-t border-slate-200 bg-slate-50" aria-labelledby="pricing-faq-heading"><div class="sb-shell grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-[0.8fr_1.2fr] lg:gap-16"><div><h2 id="pricing-faq-heading" class="text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-slate-950 sm:text-4xl">Before you buy.</h2><p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-slate-600">A few details to help you choose with confidence.</p></div><div class="divide-y divide-slate-200 border-y border-slate-200"><details class="group py-5"><summary class="cursor-pointer rounded text-base font-semibold text-slate-950 outline-offset-4 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-blue-600">How long do my credits last?</summary><p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600">Credits are valid for 3 months from purchase. Unused credits expire at the end of that period, so choose a pack that fits your expected usage.</p></details><details class="group py-5"><summary class="cursor-pointer rounded text-base font-semibold text-slate-950 outline-offset-4 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-blue-600">Does one message always use one credit?</summary><p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600">No. Long messages and messages using Unicode characters may use multiple credits. Check the credit count for your final message before sending, especially when using Sinhala or Tamil.</p></details><details class="group py-5"><summary class="cursor-pointer rounded text-base font-semibold text-slate-950 outline-offset-4 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-blue-600">Are these prices final?</summary><p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600">The prices on this page are indicative. Confirm the current credit rate, taxes, and any sender-name setup costs with the team or in your account before you buy.</p></details><details class="group py-5"><summary class="cursor-pointer rounded text-base font-semibold text-slate-950 outline-offset-4 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-blue-600">What happens after I get started?</summary><p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600">You’ll open the SMS Buddy account portal. Set up your account, review the available credit options, and arrange your sender name before sending branded messages. Sender names may require approval.</p></details></div></div></section></main><!--$--><!--/$--></div><footer class="sb-footer"><div class="sb-shell"><div class="sb-footer-top"><div><a aria-label="SMS Buddy home" href="/"><span class="sb-brand"><svg viewBox="0 0 72 88" width="36" height="36" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 4H42C55 4 64 13 64 25C64 32 61 37 56 40C63 43 67 49 67 57C67 69 57 76 43 76H19L8 83C6 84 4 83 4 80V10C4 7 7 4 10 4ZM21 27C15 27 12 31 12 37V58C12 60 14 61 16 59L23 54H37C45 54 49 48 49 41C49 33 44 27 37 27Z" fill="currentColor" fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg><span>SMS Buddy</span></span></a><p>Small messages.<br/>Stronger connections.</p><span>Business SMS for Sri Lanka.</span></div><div><h2>Product</h2><a href="/features">Features</a><a href="/pricing">Pricing</a><a href="https://portal.smsbuddy.lk/register" data-cta-location="footer">Get Started</a></div><div><h2>Made for you</h2><a href="/for-smes">Small businesses</a><a href="/for-agencies">Agencies</a><a hre